{"id":"n32185-2-8","stage":0,"title":"소설 · 小说书","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32185-2-8-1","ko":"요즘 어떤 소설이 잘 팔리니?","zh":"最近哪类小说卖得比较好？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소설이","meaning":"小说书","explanation":"소설：小说书；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소설","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32185","senseId":"2","lemma":"소설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팔리니?","meaning":"被卖掉，被卖出","explanation":"팔리다：被卖掉，被卖出；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"팔리다","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71483","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"88c77f43092f9156","term":"소설","zh":"小说书","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3","entryId":"32185","definition":"载入了小说的书。","pronunciation":["소ː설"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryI